TATTOOS

Tattoos are permanent body art that can be applied to various body slots.
They serve both cosmetic and mechanical purposes in SneezyMUD.

<g>GETTING TATTOOS<1>
Visit a tattoo artist to create custom tattoos for 100000 talens.
Immortals can also bestow custom tattoos using the BESTOW command.

<g>TATTOO LOCATIONS<1>
Tattoos can be placed on most body slots:
  Head, Neck, Body, Arms, Hands, Legs, Feet, etc.


<g>VIEWING TATTOOS<1>
- Use LOOK <person> to see someone's tattoos on unequipped slots
- Tattoos are displayed where equipment would normally appear
- They show as "<Tattooed on X>" instead of "<Worn on X>"

<g>STAT BONUSES<1>
Tattoos provide stat bonuses when placed on unequipped body slots!
Bonuses are based on animal and color keywords in the tattoo description.

For complete details on tattoo stat bonuses, see: HELP TATTOO STATS

<g>IMPORTANT NOTES<1>
- Tattoos are permanent once applied
- They only show when no equipment is worn on that slot  
- Stat bonuses only apply when the slot is unequipped
- Bonuses scale with your character level

<g>EXAMPLES<1>
A "blue dragon" tattoo on an unequipped arm provides STR, SPE, and HP bonuses.
A "green lion" tattoo on an unequipped head provides STR and Movement bonuses.

